Homepage: https://github.com/svoya-os/sos
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: svoya-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         btrfs-progs,
         calamares (>= 3.3.14~),
         cryptsetup,
         dosfstools,
         efibootmgr,
         python3,
         rsync,
         squashfs-tools,
         sudo-rs | sudo
Description: SOS installer (Calamares configuration and branding)
 Calamares settings for installing SOS from the live medium: btrfs with
 subvolumes (@, @home, @snapshots, @var_log, @var_cache, @containers,
 @swap, @ai), optional LUKS2 encryption, signed shim/GRUB, dracut, offline
 GPU drivers from the medium's pool, snapper and the first-run flag.
 Only installed in the live image; the installer removes itself.
